Method (build.py):
  - Inheritance: locale > parentLocale (supplementalData, non-component) or truncation > ... > root.
    Root supplies no territory/subdivision names, so it never fills a value.
  - Countries: resolved from the unresolved XML in common/main at cldr-json's draft threshold
    (approved/contributed), then checked against cldr-localenames-full@49.0.0: 0 mismatches over all
    139 mapped locales. XML values with lower draft status (unconfirmed/provisional) are NOT used;
    they are listed in missing.tsv with the value quoted in the reason.
  - Subdivisions: common/subdivisions/<locale>.xml, all draft levels accepted (almost all CLDR
    subdivision names are draft="provisional"); draft status per value is in subdivisions-source.tsv.
    Values are verbatim, including CLDR's own disambiguating superscripts (e.g. "…²"; 538 values).
  - countries-source.tsv / subdivisions-source.tsv record the CLDR locale each value came from
    (own vs inherited).
